uickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"You will create a root authority with a new key kept by a Lamassu engine. The result is an active CA and its public certificate in `ca.pem`, ready to verify issuance in the next path."},"2505":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Console access and permission to create keys and authorities."},"2506":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"An available cryptographic engine that supports the chosen algorithm."},"2507":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"OpenSSL 3.x to check the downloaded certificate."},"2508":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Use an evaluation instance or an authority intended for these tests. The example creates a root that issues directly; to design an operational hierarchy, see Hierarchy and rotation."},"2509":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"In **Certification Authorities**, select **Create New CA** and choose to create a CA with a new key pair."},"2510":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"The &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** flow is explained in the authorities guide."},"2511":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"Choose the engine that will keep the key and an algorithm its capabilities allow. For this example, you can use **EC P-384** if available."},"2512":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"The CA private key is used through the engine. In this path, you will download only the authority's public certificate."},"2513":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2518":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/platform/pki/quickstar