amassu","content":"Las CRD de Gateway API y Envoy, el controlador Envoy Gateway, una `GatewayClass`, un balanceador y la ruta de red externa"},"373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"TLS"},"374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"En el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`, recursos `Issuer` y `Certificate` CA de cert-manager y un `Certificate` downstream gestionado por el chart; en el modo `tls.type: external`, una referencia a tu Secret TLS"},"375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"cert-manager solo para el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS ya poblado"},"376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Datos persistentes de la aplicación"},"377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"PersistentVolumeClaims necesarios para el almacenamiento local predeterminado de KMS y VA"},"378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Una StorageClass, almacenamiento físico, backups y un backend compartido/externo cuando el escalado lo requiera"},"379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Integraciones opcionales"},"380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Puntos de configuración para observabilidad, conectores AWS y conectividad PKCS#11/HSM"},"381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Los backends de observabilidad, credenciales cloud y un HSM de producción o servicio externo de claves"},"382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart crea el `Gateway` y las rutas de Lamassu. No instala el controlador Envoy Gateway ni hace que el Service `LoadBalancer` generado sea accesible desde tu red."},"383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu en los puertos 80 y 443 y deja que sus HTTPRoutes distribuyan el tráfico a todos los servicios. Proporciona a ese Gateway un único endpoint accesible mediante el balanceador del clúster, o reenvía tráfico desde un proxy externo o un dispositivo NAT. No necesitas un Gateway por servicio."},"384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El chart crea un `Gateway` compartido por cada release de Helm. Todos los recursos `HTTPRoute` gestionados por el chart se conectan a él. Envoy Gateway provisiona el data plane del proxy y un Service `LoadBalancer` de Kubernetes para ese Gateway."},"385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El valor `gateway.addresses` solo solicita una dirección al controlador del Gateway. No hace que una IP sea enrutable, abre un firewall, configura DNS ni crea NAT. Consulta Expón el Gateway antes de definirlo."},"386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Kubernetes 1.24 o posterior"},"387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Helm 3.2 o posterior"},"388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8 o posterior y una `GatewayClass`"},"389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"cert-manager 1.14 o posterior; necesario solo para el modo TLS predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`, no para `tls.type: external`"},"390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"almacenamiento persistente adecuado para la configuración elegida de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, VA y KMS"},"391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"una implementación de balanceador o alguna otra ruta deliberada desde los clientes hasta el Gateway"},"392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Los despliegues KMS que usan el sidecar PKCS#11 nativo requieren Kubernetes 1.29 o posterior. Las imágenes de contenedor precompiladas de Lamassu se publican para `linux/amd64` y `linux/arm64`, y el módulo cliente PKCS#11 del KMS (`p11-kit-client.so`) se instala en la ruta de biblioteca Debian de la arquitectura destino: `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/pkcs11/p11-kit-client.so` en amd64 y `/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/pkcs11/p11-kit-client.so` en arm64. La ruta x86\\_64 se conserva como alias de compatibilidad para configuraciones existentes."},"393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Instala con Helm\" description=\"Prepara dependencias, configura valores, instala y verifica un despliegue controlado.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/helm\" />"},"394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Actualiza desde 3.8.0\" description=\"Actualiza una release de Helm existente a 4.0.0: cambios de arquitectura, breaking changes, pasos de migración y validación.\" href=\"/docs/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0\" />"},"395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Expón el Gateway\" description=\"Elige un diseño de tráfico externo, comprende gateway.addresses y gestiona varios Gateways.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/networking\" />"},"396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Usa Fastlane\" description=\"Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio con un script.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane\" />"},"397":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas de despliegue","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting"},"398":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura."},"399":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"400":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"401":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"402":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"403":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"404":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#errores-500-de-la-api","content":"Errores 500 de la API"},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"412":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway y un pod no preparado requieren evidencias distintas. Para emisión rechazada o resultados de validación, consulta el diagnóstico PKI; para enrolamiento, el diagnóstico EST."},"413":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si el login termina pero las APIs devuelven 403:"},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"inspecciona los claims reales del token;"},"429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que coinciden con un principal activo;"},"430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa las políticas concedidas al principal;"},"431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica que authz alcanza PostgreSQL y su JWKS."},"432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"433":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"434":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"435":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos."},"436":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"437":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"438":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"439":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#errores-500-de-la-api","content":"Un 500 indica un fallo interno, como una base de datos no disponible. El cuerpo `{\"err\": ...}` incluye hoy el texto del error interno, que puede contener nombres de esquema, tabla y restricción y, en fallos de conexión, el host y el usuario de la base de datos (no la contraseña). Localiza la causa en el log del servicio con la hora de la petición, y no reenvíes el cuerpo a terceros ni lo muestres a usuarios finales. Es un defecto conocido de divulgación de información: está previsto devolver un mensaje genérico en los 500 y dejar el detalle solo en el log del servicio (seguimiento en lamassuiot#814). El conector de autorización también devuelve el error interno, en el campo `details.error`. Algunos errores de petición, como un tamaño de clave que el motor no admite, se devuelven también como 500."},"440":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"441":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"442":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"un Secret de CA o de certificado de cliente de AMQP inexistente referenciado por `amqp.ca.secretName` o `amqp.client.secretName`;"},"443":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"444":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"445":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"},"446":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"límites de CPU o memoria demasiado bajos;"},"447":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"migración previa incompleta."},"448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los valores genéricos solicitan 100 mCPU y 128 MiB y limitan a 500 mCPU y 512 MiB. Ajusta por servicio cuando haya OOMKills, throttling o arranques lentos."},"449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Las llamadas internas ahora fallan rápido en lugar de bloquearse para los clientes cubiertos por Proxy de salida: los intentos de conexión agotan el tiempo tras 30 segundos y los handshakes TLS tras 10 segundos. El conector del motor de autorización mantiene su propio transporte sin estos timeouts de conexión ni de handshake TLS; solo su timeout global de petición de 30 segundos acota cada llamada. Si un proxy de salida gestiona el tráfico de salida del clúster, comprueba las variables de entorno `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` y `NO_PROXY` del pod e incluye los nombres de servicio internos en `NO_PROXY`."},"451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"inspecciona dead-letter queues;"},"456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"alerta sobre colas durables huérfanas y crecimiento de backlog."},"457":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Si `amqp.tls` está habilitado, revisa también la parte TLS:"},"458":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"confirma que el listener del broker hable AMQPS en el puerto configurado — el puerto por defecto sigue siendo `5672` y no cambia automáticamente al habilitar TLS;"},"459":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"si defines `amqp.ca.secretName`, confirma que el Secret exista en el namespace del release y que su clave de datos coincida con `amqp.ca.certificateKey` (por defecto `ca.crt`); si no defines `amqp.ca.secretName`, los clientes confían en las CA del sistema;"},"460":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"recuerda que un Secret referenciado inexistente impide arrancar los pods consumidores;"},"461":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"tras actualizar el Secret de la CA o del certificado de cliente, reinicia los pods consumidores: el cliente AMQP carga los certificados al arrancar."},"462":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Consulta TLS de AMQP (AMQPS) para la configuración completa."},"463":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Una caída del consumidor no siempre impide que la operación principal termine. Por eso debes monitorizar RabbitMQ y verificar de forma independiente la persistencia de auditoría."},"464":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"El chart puede habilitar la instrumentación OpenTelemetry para los servicios que la admiten, incluido authz; no configura OpenTelemetry para el AWS Connector, wfx ni la UI. Las trazas se exportan por OTLP HTTP y los logs pueden dirigirse a un endpoint compatible, como VictoriaLogs. Usa un identificador de correlación y la misma ventana temporal para unir Gateway, servicio y dependencia."},"465":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Antes de cerrar una incidencia, guarda:"},"466":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"causa confirmada;"},"467":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"alcance temporal y recursos afectados;"},"468":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"comandos o consultas utilizados;"},"469":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"cambio aplicado y forma de revertirlo;"},"470":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"validación desde un consumidor;"},"471":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"acción preventiva y propietario."},"472":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","type":"page","content":"Modelo de datos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración","Control de acceso"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model"},"473":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","content":"Entidades y relaciones del esquema pki.json que utiliza authz para evaluar políticas de acceso."},"474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#relaciones-del-esquema","content":"Relaciones del esquema"},"475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Entidades del esquema"},"476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","content":"El esquema `connectors/authz/pki.json` define las entidades del dominio `pki` para el control de acceso. Una política identifica el tipo de recurso mediante `namespace: pki`, `schema_name` y `entity_type`. Por ejemplo, `ca.certificate` corresponde al esquema `ca` y al tipo de entidad `certificate`."},"477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#relaciones-del-esquema","content":"Cada flecha sale de la entidad que declara la relación y apunta a su `target_entity`. Debajo de la etiqueta aparece el valor de `foreign_key`, la columna de origen. En `pki.json`, el `name` de cada relación coincide con esa columna. El diagrama se puede pulsar para ampliarlo y recorrerlo."},"478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#relaciones-del-esquema","content":"Una política puede propagar acciones desde la entidad referenciada hacia la que declara la relación. Por ejemplo, para conceder lectura de los dispositivos de un DMS, la regla parte de `dmsmanager.dms`, apunta a `devicemanager.device` y especifica `via: dms_owner`."},"479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#relaciones-del-esquema","content":"En los filtros de acceso heredado, `authz` compara la columna `foreign_key` con la primera columna de `primary_key` de la entidad referenciada. Así, `subject_common_name` se compara con `device.id`, `issuer_meta_serial_number` con `ca_certificate.id` y los enlaces hacia `kms_key` con `kms_key.key_id`."},"480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Entidad (`schema_name.entity_type`)"},"481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Tabla (`table_name`)"},"482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Clave (`primary_key`)"},"483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`alerts.event`"},"484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/