dades-del-esquema","content":"`kms.kms_key`"},"508":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`kms_keys`"},"509":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`key_id`, `engine_id`"},"510":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`va.crl_settings`"},"511":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`crl_settings`"},"512":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"`ca_id`"},"513":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Los eventos, las suscripciones y los grupos de dispositivos tienen acciones y filtros propios. Sus listas `relations` están vacías y tienen cero referencias entrantes en el esquema. Para `ca.certificate`, `view_tables` también registra `certificates_view`."},"514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"Cada entidad declara sus acciones sobre instancias en `atomic_actions`, sus acciones sin identificador de recurso en `global_actions` y las columnas y tipos que admite en `column_filters` mediante `filterable`."},"515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model#entidades-del-esquema","content":"<Card title=\"Acceso heredado por relaciones\" href=\"/docs/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-heredado-por-relaciones\" />"},"516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"page","content":"Visión general del control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración","Control de acceso"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control"},"517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"518":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Conceptos esenciales"},"519":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Dos sistemas de decisión"},"520":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Servicios HTTP integrados o externos"},"521":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control#rutas-solo-de-autenticación-y-rutas-no-mapeadas","content":"Rutas solo de autenticación y rutas no mapeadas"},"522":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Servicios desarrollados por Lamassu"},"523":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/a