,"page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"Opera el inventario de DMS"},"939":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Integra los dispositivos"},"940":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Un &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** configura la admisión y el ciclo de identidad de sus dispositivos. Actúa como autoridad de registro; la CA indicada en `Enrollment CA` firma los certificados. Esta guía se dirige a quien administra esa política."},"941":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas permisos para gestionar DMS, una CA activa con clave utilizable y un perfil de emisión probado. Acuerda con el integrador ID del dispositivo, credencial inicial, consumidor y ventana de renovación. Revisa la estrategia de aprovisionamiento antes de elegir registro y sustitución."},"942":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor EST y acceso desde el dispositivo con Despliegue. La autenticación administrativa de tu operador no sustituye la autenticación EST del dispositivo."},"943":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Crea el DMS con un nombre reconocible y conserva su ID. Las URLs EST utilizan ese identificador, no el nombre visible. Cada dispositivo conserva un DMS propietario."},"944":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige **Enrollment CA** y un perfil explícito apropiado para la identidad final. Mantén CN compatible con `Device ID`. El certificado de prueba debe permitir el uso previsto y terminar dentro de la vigencia del emisor."},"945":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Selecciona registro y autenticación del primer enrolamiento. Configura por separado la autenticación de reenrolamiento, sus umbrales y la retirada del certificado anterior. Deja ServerKeyGen deshabilitado si el cliente genera su clave."},"946":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Selecciona los certificados que devolverá `/cacerts`. Incluye explícitamente las intermedias y raíces necesarias, sin confundir distribución con instalación automática de confianza."},"947":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Guarda y vuelve a leer la configuración. Consulta `/cacerts`, realiza un enrolamiento permitido y otro rechazado, y comprueba dispositivo, serie e historial. Crear el DMS o descargar cacerts no demuestra que autenticación y emisión funcionen."},"948":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.registration_mode` permite `JITP` o `PRE_REGISTRATION`. En JITP se crea el dispositivo desconocido con el CN de la CSR como ID y el DMS como propietario. El `device_provisioning_profile` aporta etiquetas, metadatos e icono a ese alta."},"949":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"En PRE\\_REGISTRATION, el ID debe existir previamente. En el código examinado, un dispositivo existente pasa antes por el control de sustitución, incluso si no tiene identidad. Consulta las condiciones de prerregistro antes de utilizar este modo."},"950":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Campo de `settings.enrollment_settings`"},"951":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-