/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"URL HTTP del servicio de CA de Lamassu."},"1419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"El conector gestiona el lado AWS de cuatro tipos de recursos: CAs, plantillas de aprovisionamiento de DMS (JITP), certificados de dispositivo y Things. Esta sección mapea los eventos del bus que consume el conector a los recursos de AWS que toca y a las llamadas AWS que ejecuta cada flujo. La máquina de estados de cada recurso está junto a su explicación detallada; la última columna enlaza a ella. Los recursos de AWS se referencian con la notación `IoTCore/<recurso>`."},"1420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"La columna **Tipo de CloudEvent** lista el nombre del evento en el bus interno de Lamassu; la columna **Acciones IAM** lista las operaciones exactas del SDK de AWS que invoca cada flujo, para que los permisos necesarios se deriven directamente de esta tabla."},"1421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Tipo de CloudEvent"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Recurso en Lamassu"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Recurso AWS"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Acciones IAM"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Llamadas AWS y efecto"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Dónde en esta página"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"`EventCreateCAKey` / `EventImportCAKey` / `EventUpdateCAMetadataKey`"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"CA"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-122","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"`IoTCore/CACertificate`"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-123","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"`iot:GetRegistrationCode`, `iot:RegisterCACertificate`, `iot:DescribeCACertificate`, `iot:ListCACertificates`"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-124","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Carga la CA en el estado del conector; una escritura de `registration.status = REQUESTED` dispara el flujo de registro (Primary con certificado de verificación, o SNI-only) y escribe `SUCCEEDED` o `FAILED` en los metadatos de la CA."},"1432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-125","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Estados del registro de la CA"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-126","