l motor y comprueba cómo se registra la clave existente. Revisa dependencias y recursos que puedan haberse creado en el proveedor si una operación falla a mitad."},"2366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#operaciones-sobre-una-clave","content":"Cada clave registrada dispone de una vista de detalle y de varias acciones operativas."},"2367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La pantalla **View Details** concentra la información técnica y administrativa de la clave."},"2368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"En la pestaña **Overview** se muestran, entre otros, estos campos:"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Key Name**: nombre descriptivo."},"2370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Key Identifier**: identificador único del sistema. Lamassu utiliza formatos de ID basados en PKCS11."},"2371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Tags**: etiquetas asociadas."},"2372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Aliases**: nombres alternativos."},"2373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor en el que reside la clave."},"2374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Algorithm, Key Size & Strength**: algoritmo, parámetros y nivel de fortaleza."},"2375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La sección **Related Entities** muestra qué objetos de Lamassu dependen de esa clave."},"2376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La pestaña **Public Key** muestra el material público en PEM. El identificador y la URI del registro sirven para localizar la clave; una URI con formato PKCS#11 no demuestra que el motor sea un HSM ni que exista un módulo local para acceder a ella."},"2377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-69/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":